lib/viz.ts: four data colours (keep/support/hold/kill) validated with the
dataviz six-checks validator on the paper surface (#F6F7F4); colour follows
the entity's tier, text never wears a data colour; mark specs (20 px bars,
2 px surface gaps, 4 px data-end radius, ≥ 8 px dots).

components/viz:
- Figure          frame: title, legend (≥ 2 tiers), caption
- ProgressionRail OBSERVE→EXECUTE; AUTHORIZE/EXECUTE hatched = locked (D-007)
- SafetyChainDiagram ten stages, probabilistic vs deterministic zones, one boundary
- ArchitectureMap GridOS kernel spine + nine modules, probabilistic dashed
- StatusBar, ValueRiskMatrix registry by status; strategic value × security risk
- KpiTiles        hero revenue, explicit "not measured", meter vs target
- WedgeFunnel     counted vs 90-day target (all zero, shown as zero)
- DecisionTimeline append-only log on a time axis, proposed = hollow
- ResearchMatrix  benchmark fields per topic — no full row yet, by design

Wired into home (cluster-1 card), /energy and every control page; all
charts are server-rendered SVG with <title> hover and a table twin on the
same page. Data additions: PROGRESSION_STATE (architecture.ts), FUNNEL
(wedge.ts). AGENTS.md gains the visualization rules; MIGRATION.md records
the layer. Verified: tsc clean, next build prerenders 118 pages,
screenshots reviewed for label collisions.

